From f505fe0ed548b0ed2b87c6f2670b0ef57b7ad924 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Senior Matthew <SeniorMatt@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 14:28:21 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] kcm_konlineaccounts: List page that opens before any D-Bus
 call is answered
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Page type: List (docs/page-design.md): account list, "Add Account…" page action, per-account sub-page. Stored
settings, D-Bus API and the account setup flow are unchanged.

Moved / renamed:
- Empty state "No accounts configured" now has an "Add Account…" button (kcm_konlineaccounts/AccountList,
  kcm_konlineaccounts/AddAccount). The empty/"service not running" messages wait for the first reply, so
  they do not flash while loading; a spinner shows only after 150 ms.
- The Create Account dialog (kcm_konlineaccounts/createBuilder) is built by a Loader only when opened (button,
  or the "add" launch argument). It referenced main.qml's id addAccountDialog to close itself; now uses its own root.
- The account page gets the name from the row (accountName), the blocking lookup is only a fallback.
- Markers only (no label change) for Finish, OK, SuggestedApp, AddAccount so --strict can prove them.
- inventory/relabel/kcm_konlineaccounts.tsv (outer repo); 8 rows, 0 lost with --strict.

Speed cause (read from code, kcm/kcm.cpp + kcm/accountsmodel.cpp):
- serviceRunning() was a blocking isServiceRegistered() call evaluated by QML bindings on the first frame, and the
  AccountsModel constructor did the same; now async NameHasOwner + QDBusServiceWatcher.
- AccountsModel::data() made a blocking Properties.Get per role per row (name, types, icon: 3 calls/account, and a
  missing service means a D-Bus timeout per call). Now one async GetAll per account, cached, with dataChanged on reply.
- removeAccount() is async too.
- AddAccountDialog (provider plugin enumeration in AvailableAccountsModel) was created with the page.
After: pending, manager will measure.

HIG: HIG-001, HIG-005, HIG-006, HIG-020 (empty state with action).

Not built yet. Things to check at build: QDBusPendingReply<QVariantMap> from GetAll gives the "types" entry as QStringList
(the old Get call relied on the same unwrapping); model rows now show empty text until the reply arrives; reply order
for "service not running" relies on the KCM's NameHasOwner call being sent before the model's (same connection).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01X5N5x9eWzmrq6QYrYLwQnk
